8. u3 {d}utu-na-s,i-ir _dumu_ {d}utu-dingir 
9. {disz}be-le-su2-nu _lukur_ {d}utu _dumu-munus_ ta-ri-ba-tum 
10. i-na _har ku3-babbar_-sza _in-szi-in-sa10_ 
